.TH ORO-PLATFORM 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:platform \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:platform'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Inspects platform backend availability and calls explicitly configured compiled Android and Linux extensions through document\-owned IPC. No JavaScript module or executable path is loaded natively. Compiled extension request backends for iOS/iPadOS, macOS and Windows are not implemented and reject ENOSYS. `getSupport(feature)` returns the native inventory's missing/restricted reason; an implemented descriptor is not OS/hardware or deployment qualification. Shared encrypted\-record support is a separate API.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBrequest(extension, action, payload, options)\fR
Invokes a narrowly named native operation with a JSON object payload. Requests require a foreground interactive document, expire after 90 seconds and share native capacity limits. Results are limited to 512 KiB. The extension must implement its own feature authorization; trusted origin is not server IAM. Unregistered extensions and unimplemented platforms reject with ENOSYS.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIextension\fR (string; required) Configured extension name.
.br
\fIaction\fR (string; required) Operation name.
.br
\fIpayload\fR (object; optional)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (PlatformRequestOptions; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<any>\fR
.TP
\fBgetCapabilities()\fR
Reads the compiled backend inventory on every platform without prompting, loading extensions or accessing saved data. An implemented backend is not proof of hardware, OS admission, current permission or device qualification.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<PlatformCapabilities>\fR
.TP
\fBgetSupport(feature)\fR
Reads one compiled native feature descriptor without prompting. Query the feature's own support/status API before starting an operation. Missing and OS\-restricted features are separate results; operational calls still reject.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIfeature\fR (PlatformFeature; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<PlatformFeatureSupport>\fR
